flowchart TD
 S[Symptom + own description] --> H[3-5 hypotheses]
 H --> Q{Highest-information question?}
 Q -->|C state / control flow| G[GDB]
 Q -->|memory safety / selected UB| A[ASan / UBSan]
 Q -->|OS boundary timeline| T[strace]
 Q -->|live process / FD snapshot| P[/proc]
 Q -->|build / ELF| E[compiler / linker / nm / readelf / objdump]
 Q -->|binary contract| X[golden bytes / od / codec]
 G --> N[Narrow scope -> root cause -> fix -> regression]
 A --> N
 T --> N
 P --> N
 E --> N
 X --> N
